<title>USA: Westwood Financial sets special div $0.05.</title>
<headline>Westwood Financial sets special div $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>WESTWOOD, N.J. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westwood Financial Corp said it declared a special dividend of $0.05 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on or about October 17 to shareholders of record on July 31.</p>
<p>The company said it is paying the dividend as a result of its continued profitability and that of its holding comapany.</p>
<p>Westwood Financial Corp is the holding company of Westwood Savings Bank.</p>
